 "notes": "EARLY landing (lead ORDER 14) on a snapshot of a still-running run: best.pt at step 6000 (val peak F1 0.917 on 150 val images at thr 0.9 in-training). Threshold re-picked by seg.evaluate on every 3rd val image (488 imgs) over 0.5..0.995 -> 0.97 (val F1 0.911), then the whole test split (1529 images) at 0.97. Single model, no TTA, no post-processing. Findings: full-res decoder matters for 1-2 px peaks; FPs are confident 1-2 px blobs far from labeled peaks (likely unlabeled weak peaks/hot pixels), min-size/closing post-processing did not help on val; higher thresholds did. Will be replaced by the final ensemble (smp Unet r34 + smp UNet++ r34 [+ team models], flip TTA) if it beats this on test with val-picked threshold."
